window.products.push({"id":829136,"name":"Mind Reader Metal Stand, Umbrella Holder, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ftcjv+LyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Mind Reader metal umbrella stand offers a stylish and functional solution for storing wet or dry umbrellas in your home or office. The cut-out design is not only decorative, but also allows for airflow for faster drying of your wet umbrellas on rainy days. DURABLE AND STABLE METAL CONSTRUCTION: This umbrella holder is designed with a heavy-duty metal frame and tall, slender construction to keep your umbrellas in place. It can hold all of your umbrellas without tipping over. RUST-RESISTANT: This umbrella holder features a rust-resistant coating and offers high stability and long-lasting use. FITS EASILY IN MOST SPACES: This item measures 7.50 inches L by 7.50 inches W by 18.75 inches H. The tall, round, slender design fits easily in most spaces, even in small areas. Place it in your foyer, hallway, on your patio, by your front door at home or at the office for storage of umbrellas or other items that are frequently used. PROTECTS FLOORS: This umbrella stand helps to protect floors from water on rainy days, especially rugs, carpet, and wood floors. DECORATIVE LOOK: The fun yet sleek, decorative cut-out design adds an eye-catching touch to your space, even on sunny days. VERSATILE: Use this umbrella stand to hold umbrellas, but it can be used to organize and store more than umbrellas! This metal stand can also be used for other items. Use it to store walking sticks, canes, poles, and children's toys. This decorative stand helps to keep your home or office dry and clean on rainy days. EASY CARE: This item is easy to clean. Simply wipe the smooth metal with a dry or damp cloth as needed. If using this stand for a busy and active area such as an office, consider using more than one for ample umbrella storage and an attractive look in your space. You'll never have trouble finding your umbrellas large or small again with this Mind Reader metal umbrella stand! It fits umbrellas of all sizes and keeps them in one place for clutter-free organization of your umbrellas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ftcjv+LyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mind Reader","source_asin":"B08D51ZQLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D51ZQLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D51ZQLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
