window.products.push({"id":829365,"name":"Microtex innovation- Set of 2 Decorative Pillows with Stuffing Included, 18x18 Throw Pillows with Solid Colors, Filled Square Cushions for Bed, Fillin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511OJ3iSOML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Many times, choosing decorative throw pillows can be as difficult as choosing the right garment for an important event. To create a pleasant atmosphere at home, various interior elements and accessories are used, some of which are cute decorative cushions and décor that fill our home with an atmosphere of peace and warmth. That is why we must always keep in mind QUALITY, GOOD CHOICE, and TRUST. This is what our deluxe comfort throw pillows offer, making any place feel like home. Microtex Fabrics make our luxurious accent throw pillows in the USA. Microtex Fabrics is a family-owned and operated textile converter for the home decor and hospitality market. We have30 years of experience in the field, providing our clients with the best service and quality. We have found and produced a wide variety of different luxurious fabrics to satisfy every customer's appearance. We strive to provide high-quality products and we are on a mission to ensure your satisfaction. The cushions made by Microtex Fabricsfeature the finest quality fabric. The microsuede fabric used to make our pillows for couches and sofas is suitable for pets and children. The accent pillows have lightweight, comfortable fibers, and improves perspiration so that it provides you with comfort while using these soft throw pillows for your couch and the peace of mind of not suffering from any type of allergy. We have more than 10different designs and colors. This allows all of our clients to choose the right decorative throw pillows according to their interests and tastes. MAINTENANCE TIPS: To collect dust, gently vacuum the cap. Then gently pat it with a well-wrung damp cloth. Use baby wipes to remove small marks, staining the area with a slight rubbing and twisting motion. To restore the soft nap and cover shine of our decorative pillows, quickly brush them up with a medium bristle brush or lint brush. Use a lint roller to remove pet hair.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511OJ3iSOML._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Microtex innovation","source_asin":"B08VNNKCMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VNNKCMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VNNKCMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
