window.products.push({"id":829376,"name":"Spiritual Hustle Healing Candles with Crystals Set, Soy Wax Essential Oil, Sage Purification Candle, Lavender Calming Candle, Abundance Mediation Cand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619GsKPv99L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"SPIRITUAL HUSTLE Earth - My Body Water - My Blood Air - My Breath and Fire - My Spirit Every person on Earth lives in harmony with the four elements... However qualitatively and deeply these elements will be manifested in a person's life, the happier and more harmonious his or her existence will be. We have created a manifestation set of three candles that will help cleanse what does not belong to you, help bring body, spirit, and mind into balance, and help bring abundance and prosperity into our lives. These candles also consist of the four most important and basic elements of our life. Element Earth - Gemstones. These are the treasures of Mother Earth, glittering gems, stones, and rock crystals born from elemental energy. In one candle, they can capture the sun, moon, salt seas, soil, and mountains and they can transmute all that healing power back to us. Element Water -Essential Oils. These Essential Oils are basically planted and flower extracts. When inhaled, the scent molecules in essential oils travel from the olfactory nerves directly to the brain and especially impact the amygdala, the emotional center of the brain. They help to relieve stress quickly, enable better sleep, increase energy, focus the mind, clean the house, and create an aura away from dark energy, allowing wealth and abundance to come to one’s life. Element Fire - Candle’s Flame. The element of fire is very powerful. It cleans and burns everything negative that adheres to a person's aura. The importance of the candle flame is the biological field that surrounds a person and it helps to cleanse the body of everything that accumulates every day. Element Air – Affirmations. Affirmations are positive statements that can help you to challenge and overcome self-sabotaging and negative thoughts. When you repeat them often and believe in them, you can start to make positive changes. Self-affirmation may also help to mitigate the effects of stress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619GsKPv99L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spiritual Hustle","source_asin":"B099F14W9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099F14W9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099F14W9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":829377,"name":"SearchI Kids Hooded Bath Towel for Boys Girls Toddlers Children Age 2 to 6 Years, Cotton Soft Absortbent Hooded Poncho Towel for Bath Shower Pool Swim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eZ4a53wJL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"About SearchI: SearchI is focused on producing high quality HOME&KITCHEN products, bring customers various goods at reasonable prices. Customer Support: Please contact us anytime if you have any problems or dissatisfaction. We want our customers to be 100% happy and satisfied. Every penny you spend will be guaranteed.  100% Cotton for Softness and Strength:  Made of 100% cotton terry, the hooded towel feature a looped terry design for enhanced absorption and moisture retention. The cotton hooded towels are lightweight, quick drying, and feature reinforced edges to prevent unraveling. Soft to the touch, they are gentle enough for everyday use on kids. Double Stitched Hemmed Finishing:  The towels come with double stitched hemmed finishing for less amount of disintegration after washing. Your Kids Will Love This Hooded Towel Wrap:  Cute astronaut cartoon patterns on a black space background, kids like them. This quick drying towel is outfitted with a built in hood to keep hair dry and features a snap button on each side to keep the towel secure while providing sleeves for their arms, makes this hooded towel wrap perfect for after a bath or a day at the pool or beach or even at the swimming pool. Our customers have used the kids hooded towels as baby bathrobes, as a baby poncho at the pool, or as a toddler hooded towel at the beach. It is 23x24 inches and fits ages 2-6 years.  How to Care:  Wash before first use. Machine wash in cold water with gentle detergent, gentle cycle. Avoid fabric softeners, bleaching agents, household cleaning products, personal care products that contain peroxide and laundry detergents containing harsh optical brighteners. Tumble dry on low heat, remove promptly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eZ4a53wJL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SearchI","source_asin":"B07C6C7R98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829377","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C6C7R98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C6C7R98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
