window.products.push({"id":829415,"name":"Souvia 8 in 1 Multi Cooker – 7 Quart - Programmable LCD Control Panel - 8 Preset Functions: Slow Cooker - Brown/Saute - Steam - Bake - Grill - Sear Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816lMA-6jzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Souvia Multi Cooker all in one cooking pot makes meal preparation, baking and cooking a “piece of cake.” No more slaving away over the hot stove or deep fat fryer when you can use one state of the art cooking machine for everything. 8 Cooking Functions: ✔ Slow Cook.✔ Brown/Saute.✔ Steam.✔ Bake.✔ Grill.✔ Sear.✔ Meat Stew.✔ Yogurt. Unleash the Creative Cook Within! The multicooker appliance gives you the chance to express your creativity in the kitchen without making a mess or worrying if you have the right type of kitchen equipment available.Try Your hand at homemade yogurt, thick and crusty loaves of bread, or perfectly steamed rice for sushi. Boil, bake, simmer, fry, braise, grill, roast, and slow cook food all in one pot! With One Product, You Can Replace Common Kitchen Appliances: ❌ Slow Cooker,❌ Grill Pans,❌ Roasting Pan,❌ Dutch Oven, Healthy Meals at the Touch of a Button! Instead of frying food or ordering fast food from your local takeout you can prepare delicious, nutritious and healthy home cooked meals in this revolutionary kitchen gadget.We all lead busy lives, but eating healthy food should be a priority for everyone.Simply Place vegetables, rice, beans or hot cereal into the pot. Set the correct program and enjoy healthy, homemade food every day. Your family will thank you when they come home to delicious smells wafting from your warm kitchen. Specifications & Features: 🍴 8 cooking Settings🍴 Time & Temperature Digital Control🍴 Programmable LCD Panel 🍴 Easy Carry Handles🍴 Keep Warm Function🍴 Tempered Glass Lid with Safety Locking System🍴 Capacity: 7 Quarts🍴 Removable, Dishwasher Safe Ceramic Pot 🍴 Rating: 1500w, 120v, 60hz🍴 ETL Listed🍴 Includes: Metal Rack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816lMA-6jzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magic Mill","source_asin":"B07816CPNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07816CPNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07816CPNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
