window.products.push({"id":829651,"name":"Denby James Martin Dine Large Serving Dish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uhxvs1ypL._AC_.jpg","description":"Denby recently brought chef James Martin to the US with the introduction of Dine. In addition to the James Martin Collection are James Martin Squares and Serving Items. Each piece has been developed utilizing the unique Dine 'step' design element. White by Denby reflects the purity and simplicity expected from a white collection while offering contemporary shapes that could only come from the Denby design team. White Squares is an accent which offers an alternative to the soft, rounded shapes of White. Mix and match to give your table an added twist. Anyone who owns Denby will tell you how versatile it is and how good it feels. Every piece has been designed for cooking, serving and eating food � from the �gravy rim� on our plates to the space on our saucers for biscuits. Our tableware is made for real food, not just for show. It�s for sharing, for fingers, for chopsticks, for barbeques, for kitchens�you choose. Denby can handle itself in the busiest kitchens. From the smallest cup to the biggest casserole, all our pieces can be used with confidence in the microwave, dishwasher and freezer. We've got over 5000 glazes, all harder than steel. It's taken us 180 years to get our glazes as flawless as they are, meaning our tableware washes more easily, but chips less easily. Denby is smashing stuff! Our tableware is really much harder to crack than other tableware. Each Denby piece is unique. It passes through 25 pairs of hands before reaching yours, including a test to make it as comfortable as possible to hold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31uhxvs1ypL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Denby","source_asin":"B00427KSQI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00427KSQI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00427KSQI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
