window.products.push({"id":829775,"name":"Dr. Beauty Hair Dryer Holder - Vanity Tool Accessories Tray, Bathroom Countertop Organizer - Wood Rustic Home Decor, Perfume, Makeup, Styling Tools, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A-2hzbyIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your New Favorite Bathroom Vanity OrganizerElegant, Convenient, and Reliable Holder by Dr. BeautyForget multiple trays and storage organizers that take up too much space in your bathroom or closet. Keep your selfcare essentials in one place with the Dr. Beauty Hair Dryer Holder!Featuring a classic wood construction paired with a luxurious and minimalist color designed to effortlessly match interiors and go together with the rest of your home decor and other organizers. It measures 12.8 x 7.8 x 6.3 inches (33 x 20 x 16 cm) compact enough to fit on top of bathroom tables, countertops, storage racks, and more. This minimalist shelf is available in 6 colors and accents that will complete your interior.Vanity Storage and Hair Dryer OrganizerOrganizing your arsenal of important vanity pieces can be considered somewhat challenging. You need to choose a shelf that supports and fits your accessories to prevent creating a space that's crowded with cabinets and racks. With Dr. Beauty, keeping your care accessories has never been this easy!This storage rack safekeeps your blow dryer and keeps it secure when not in use, so you won't have to go through the hassle of opening and closing drawers when you need to use the hairdryer. It's curated to let you save space by giving your perfume, makeup tools, accessories, brushes, and styling tools a new home!A Gift for Friends and FamilyCelebrate milestones and never come emptyhanded again to your friend's and family's housewarming by bringing a convenient gift that will last them a long time. This rustic bathroom accessories stand will surely bring a smile to their faces and convenience in their daily lives. With multiple storage slots and compact size, this holder will find its way to your loved one's list of favorite home decors.Click 'Add to Cart' now and give your vanity pieces a new home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A-2hzbyIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dr.Beauty","source_asin":"B096C4999G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096C4999G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096C4999G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
