window.products.push({"id":829951,"name":"Bacon Grease Container with Fine Mesh Strainer 1.3 L / 44 oz Stainless Steel Cooking Oil Keeper with Lid and Tray Easy-Grip Handle Suitable for Storin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C466wOAZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Durable Material】: Container are made of Food-grade 304 stainless steel. Thickened body and extra filter. High-temperature resistance. Not easy to deform. With a lid, it is effective to isolate dust. 【Filters & Stores Efficiently】: Extend the life of your delicious bacon grease by pouring the melted bacon fat through the strainer, keeping the fitted lid on your container, and storing it in the refrigerator. Can be stored right next to your stove or in your refrigerator. Can be hand-cleaned or in your dishwasher for thorough cleaning. 【Large Capacity】: 1.3 L / 44 oz capacity. This oil strainer pot helps us separate food from fat and reduce fat intake. Constructed with a curved comfortable handle that keeps your hand safe from hot grease, The lid can be closed without removing the strainer. 【Multifunction Kitchen Container】: Easy to separate food pieces from cooking oil, you can pour the hot grease into the grease can immediately for later use. Helps us solve the problem of the reuse of cooking oil. Filter and store used cooking oil, coconut oil, bacon grease, fat, frying oil, hot oil, and so on, also can be used to store other liquid seasonings. 【Upgrade Design】: Ergonomic easy-grip handle. The stainless steel fine mesh filter makes the filtering effect better. The edge small pouring port is designed to be more rapid in the process of pouring oil, which can prevent any leakage. The stainless steel base effectively prevents slippage. Avoid running oil on the countertop. The kitchen is neat and clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C466wOAZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tellshun","source_asin":"B0B45WNF6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B45WNF6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B45WNF6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
