window.products.push({"id":829961,"name":"1100 Pieces Clear Wedding Table Scatter Confetti Crystals Acrylic Diamonds Rhinestones for Table Centerpiece Decorations Wedding Decorations Vase Bead","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H54RKkx2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Color:Clear/Muti/Black/Blue/Green/Pink/Purple/Rose/YellowSize: 10 mmMaterial: acrylicQuantity: 1100 packPacking weight:11 OZPackage includes:1100 x Clear table scatter crystals1100 pack clear wedding table scatter confetti crystals acrylic diamonds 10 mm rhinestones for table centerpiece, wedding, bridal shower, vase beads decorationsAdd some sparkle:Acrylic crystal diamonds look beautiful and shiny, they can add sparkle and glamour to your wedding and party tables, create a fun and festive party atmosphere.Multiple uses:Suitable for handmade accessories like personalized ornaments and can also be combine with water beads to make floral designs. Like rhinestones, they can be used at themed birthday parties, graduations, anniversaries, holidays, bridal decorations, and winter seasonal decor! Warm note: Keep away from children under 3 years of age. These are faux diamonds and not real diamonds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H54RKkx2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meching","source_asin":"B07TJG4PJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TJG4PJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TJG4PJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":829962,"name":"PackIt Freezable Hampton Lunch Bag, Navy Heather, Built with EcoFreeze Technology, Collapsible, Reusable, Zip Closure with Front Pocket and Shoulder S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lanvmC6kS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish and functional, the Hampton Freezable Lunch Bag by Packit is the lunch bag solution for the savvy meal prepper, healthy eating, commuting, at the office and more! The Hampton Lunch Bag features PackIt's groundbreaking technology: a freezable non-toxic gel liner is integrated into the walls of the lunch bag, and the entire bag freezes. The design totally eliminates the need for separate blue ice packs or gel packs. Frozen walls mean built-in cooling that chills food and drinks for hours! To use, simply flatten and place the entire bag in the freezer overnight. In the morning, the walls of the Hampton Lunch Bag will be completely frozen and ready to pack. Because there are no extra parts, you'll never be hassling with or hunting down missing ice packs. This tote-style cooler has a roomy interior and unique rectangular base so you can carry larger containers (large meal or salad, a snack and a 12 ounce drink) on the go. It also fits PackIt's Mod Snack, Lunch or Flex modular food containers (sold separately on Amazon). The top to side zipper design makes packing easy and lets you quickly access food and drinks on the go. A shoulder strap ensures portability and the vertical design keeps drinks upright and prevents spills. The Freezable Hampton Lunchbag is ideal for work, commuting, travel or errands. And it's so stylish that you'd never guess it acts like a cooler! This soft sided lunch bag is made with nontoxic gel and gel liner. The unique folding system allows bag to collapse flat for storage in the freezer. Like all PackIt products, the Hampton Bag is made from PVC free, BPA free, phthalate, and lead free (UL #B80321985, 12/5/2019) materials. PackIt's Freezable Hampton Lunch Bag measures 8.5 inches tall, 10.5 inches wide and 7.75 inches deep. Cleaning is easy: wipe thoroughly or hand wash the interior and spot clean exterior; allow bag to dry completely before freezing. Not machine or dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lanvmC6kS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PackIt","source_asin":"B08TYHK239","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-829962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TYHK239","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TYHK239","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
